meta {
  name: 13. Verify DataSet (after saga)
  type: http
  seq: 13
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/datasets/:id
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

params:path {
  id: {{sagaDataSetId}}
}

docs {
  ## Verify DataSet (after saga)

  **Precondition:** `sagaDataSetId` is set; release saga has completed (step 12).

  Retrieves the dataset to verify infrastructure fields were populated by the saga.

  **Expected Response**
  - Status: `200 OK`
  - Body contains:
    - `dataSetStatus`: `AVAILABLE`
    - `projectId`: non-null (FROST project)
    - `frostBaseUrl`: non-null (FROST project URL)
    - `routeId`: non-null (APISIX route)
    - `serviceId`: non-null (APISIX upstream)
    - `publicUrl`: non-null (gateway URL)
    - `pendingSagaType`: null (saga completed)
}
